<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy 7-yr CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy 7-yr CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a seventh tranche of 8.5 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 3.8 percent.</p>
<p>		   Nov 1, 2003 CCT	 pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   6.09 pct	 6.15</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 6.98 pct	 7.06</p>
<p>    Assigned price	100.35     100.95</p>
<p>    Total bids	  12.66 trillion lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	     8.50 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with an auction of a fifth tranche of the 3.8 percent CCTs on December 17.</p>
</text>
